# The Void — custom guided meditation inside Focus 15.
# Was levels.json "C15-VOID" until 2026-08-19; its beat/carrier/bed were F15's
# own, verbatim, because it never was a separate level.
# v1 note carried over: "source template level; the one already written"
#
# Content authored 2026-08-19 from the user's own account: their first time
# lingering in the featurelessness of F15 (distinct from F26's void proper —
# see library/segments/void.gws and focus/F15/notes.md / focus/F26/notes.md).
# Solitary session, so the solo opening/climb path is reused rather than
# opening-gathering's cohort framing.

@title    Focus 15 — The Void
@level    F10
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     1526
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use opening
use comfort
use orientation
use ocean

surf 0.30
use conversion-box
use affirmation

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use return-anchor
use clear-skies

use climb-f10-f12
use briefing-f12

use climb-f12-f15

use void

use descend-f15-f10
use return
